# ── robotmk-starter ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RCC environment: Robot Framework and Browser Library, nothing else. RCC also
# fetches Playwright's Chromium (rccPostInstall). Leaner than rf-full on purpose
# — on a two-core machine the first green run should not wait for libraries the
# course never uses.
RMKS_ENVIRONMENT=rf-libbrowser
# Devcontainer type: Checkmk site and monitored host as two containers.
RMKS_DEVCONTAINER=cmk25-split
